# Anchored to the repo root: a bare "tx" also matches the cmd/tx/ directory,
# which hides it from any tool that honours .gitignore (ripgrep, ugrep, most
# editor search). Only the built binary here should be ignored.
/tx
.codex
**/testdata/fuzz/
**/testdata/fuzz/**

# Scratch test files. Investigating a bug here usually means writing a throwaway
# test to isolate it; two such files were staged by accident before this rule
# existed. Anything named with these prefixes is exploratory by convention and
# never belongs in a commit — real tests extend an existing *_test.go file.
zz_*_test.go
tmp_*_test.go
*_scratch_test.go
